{"id":568,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"This Pokémon was born from a bag stuffed with trash. Galarian Weezing relish the fumes belched by Trubbish."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Its favorite places are unsanitary ones. If you leave trash lying around, you could even find one of these Pokémon living in your room."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"If a young Pokémon or child breathes in the toxic gas that Trubbish belches out, it could be a life-threatening situation."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Poisonous gas leaks out of it when it breathes. Muk that catch a whiff of that stench will come drooling."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It gorges on trash until its stomach is full. Then it belches toxic gas. An unlucky whiff of gas will put a person in the hospital."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Unsanitary places are what they like best. They can be spotted in Alola, often with Grimer in hot pursuit."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Black"],"text":"Inhaling the gas they belch will make you sleep for a week. They prefer unsanitary places."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White"],"text":"The combination of garbage bags and industrial waste caused the chemical reaction that created this Pokémon."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Wanting more garbage, they follow people who litter. They always belch poison gas."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Stench","hidden":false,"description":"By releasing a stench when attacking, the Pokémon may cause the target to flinch."},{"name":"Sticky Hold","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's held items cling to its sticky body and cannot be removed by other Pokémon."},{"name":"Aftermath","hidden":true,"description":"Damages the attacker if it knocks out the Pokémon with a move that makes direct contact."}],"eggGroups":["Mineral"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Green","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":568,"name":"Trubbish","condition":null,"children":[{"id":569,"name":"Garbodor","condition":"Lv. 36","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,1],[1,139],[3,278],[6,491],[9,133],[12,499],[15,390],[18,124],[21,254],[21,256],[24,36],[27,188],[30,92],[33,562],[37,220],[39,441],[42,153]],"machine":[133,213,399,409,203,263,202,441,371,182,240,156,350,496,402,120,214,188,482,173,191,164,241,168,390,599,474],"egg":[475,174,114,205,28],"tutor":[810]},"cards":[{"id":"rsv10pt5-140","name":"Trubbish","set":"White Flare","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"140","artist":"Oswaldo KATO","img":"rsv10pt5/140"},{"id":"me4-56","name":"Trubbish","set":"Chaos Rising","date":"2026-05-22","rarity":"Common","number":"56","artist":"Souichirou Gunjima","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-56/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me4-56/large"},{"id":"rsv10pt5-59","name":"Trubbish","set":"White Flare","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Common","number":"59","artist":"OKUBO","img":"rsv10pt5/59"},{"id":"sv4-116","name":"Trubbish","set":"Paradox Rift","date":"2023-11-03","rarity":"Common","number":"116","artist":"Miki Tanaka","img":"sv4/116"},{"id":"swsh8-168","name":"Trubbish","set":"Fusion Strike","date":"2021-11-12","rarity":"Common","number":"168","artist":"Shibuzoh.","img":"swsh8/168"},{"id":"swsh4-110","name":"Trubbish","set":"Vivid Voltage","date":"2020-11-13","rarity":"Common","number":"110","artist":"Kyoko Umemoto","img":"swsh4/110"},{"id":"swsh35-43","name":"Trubbish","set":"Champion's Path","date":"2020-09-25","rarity":"Common","number":"43","artist":"nagimiso","img":"swsh35/43"},{"id":"swsh2-117","name":"Trubbish","set":"Rebel Clash","date":"2020-05-01","rarity":"Common","number":"117","artist":"HYOGONOSUKE","img":"swsh2/117"},{"id":"sm2-50","name":"Trubbish","set":"Guardians Rising","date":"2017-05-05","rarity":"Common","number":"50","artist":"Yuka Morii","img":"sm2/50"},{"id":"xy9-56","name":"Trubbish","set":"BREAKpoint","date":"2016-02-03","rarity":"Common","number":"56","artist":"OOYAMA",